event: response.reasoning_summary_text.done
data: {"type":"response.reasoning_summary_text.done","sequence_number":91,"item_id":"rs_0572b5d49971fdaa016acba2902df8819692b7f0b97b05ef0a","output_index":0,"summary_index":0,"text":"**Implementing transaction helper**\n\nI think I need to create a specific transaction helper. I’ll be using an insert-select query with a condition where the position doesn't already exist, which avoids other errors. The function will record the position by inserting or ignoring if it selects the maximum unique position. I also want to ensure I guard against invalid memory by managing tasks properly before remembering them. It should be atomic and only remember changes after successfully updating ownership in the first transaction."}

